note Undefined symbols a generated library may import: C runtime (trap exit, setjmp/longjmp, memory
note copies, stack protector, the lock) and the #281 transport supplied by the executable. Anything
note else, notably open/read/write/ioctl/mmap, means the library reaches the OS outside the transport.
